*~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~ Current & Voltage Limits ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
*‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾

icc = 33 
* DESCRIPTION:   TF superconductor operating current / critical current density
* JUSTIFICATION: A quench must be avoided
* VARIABLES:     j_tf_wp & j_tf_wp_critical (critical current) calculated in-situ

f_j_tf_wp_critical_max = 0.7
* DESCRIPTION:   Constraint margin for TF superconductor operating current / critical current density
* JUSTIFICATION: Margin of 0.7 for engineering reliability

*~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

*icc = 35
* DESCRIPTION:   Constraint equation for TF coil J_wp/J_prot upper limit (SCTF)
* JUSTIFICATION: Turned off, do not care about winding pack current density
* VARIABLES:     j_tf_wp calculated in-situ

*~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

*icc = 34 
* DESCRIPTION:   Constraint equation for TF coil dump voltage upper limit (SCTF)
* JUSTIFICATION: Turned off, do not care about dump voltage
* VARIABLES:     v_tf_coil_dump_quench_kv calculated in-situ

*ixc = 52
*v_tf_coil_dump_quench_max_kv =  
*boundl(52) = 
*boundu(52) = 
* DESCRIPTION:   Max voltage across TF coil during quench (kV) (icc=34)
* JUSTIFICATION: Not yet set. Not using icc = 34

*~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

*icc = 75
* DESCRIPTION:   Ensure that TF coil current / copper area < Maximum value
* JUSTIFICATION: Turned off, not concerned with copper current density
* VARIABLES:     copperA_m2_max.copperA_m2  calculated in-situ

*coppera_m2_max =  
* DESCRIPTION:   Maximum TF coil current / copper area (A/m2)
* JUSTIFICATION: Not yet defined, assuming (default =  100E0)


*~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

*icc = 19
* DESCRIPTION:   Constraint equation for MVA upper limit in TF coil
* JUSTIFICATION: Turned off, don't care about limit
* VARIABLES:     mvalim,p_tf_leg_resistive_mw,p_cp_resistive_mw calculated in-situ

*mvalim =  
* DESCRIPTION:   Maximum MVA limit (`constraint equation 19`) (default = 40.0)
* JUSTIFICATION: Not set, not using icc = 19

