* Setting the winding pack turn numbers in each plane when using a rectangular winding pack

*n_tf_wp_layers = 10
* DESCRIPTION:   Number of layers in TF coil (i_tf_turns_integer=1)
* JUSTIFICATION: Not set, as i_tf_turns_integer = 0

